Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=action(n1,"Start the Request for Quotation process"); source=i1:The process starts with the Request for Quotation; reason=The action alters the target by inventing the qualifier 'process', changing the strict meaning from starting with a document (Request for Quotation) to starting an entirely distinct 'Request for Quotation process'.
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=action(n10,"End process"); source=i11:The process ends when the Goods are sent or when the Invoice is sent.; reason=The action models the end of the process but explicitly drops the crucial condition 'when the Goods are sent or when the Invoice is sent', failing to faithfully reproduce the source granularity.
